-stand","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_D7Mq7i":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/sturdy-camera-stand-for-desk-video-recording-and-streaming.jpg","text":"","author":"Layla Rogers","bio":"“Been using it for a week and I already can’t imagine not having it. It sticks perfectly and folds flat in my bag. Love that it actually looks good too.”","product":"table-stand","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_33tAjm":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/compact-desk-mount-for-mirrorless-and-dslr-cameras.jpg","text":"","author":"Sophia Morgan","bio":"“Honestly? It’s one of those things I didn’t know I needed. Now I use it every single day — especially when I’m watching Netflix in bed.”","product":"table-stand","icon":"5-stars"}},"testimonial_dDRMwy":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/professional-camera-desk-stand-for-content-creators-and-vloggers.jpg","text":"","author":"Ava Brooks","bio":"“It’s the little things — like being able to prop my phone up anywhere without worrying it’ll fall. And it actually matches my phone case!”","product":"table-stand","icon":"5-stars"}}},"block_order":["testimonial_dhi3Xf","testimonial_D7Mq7i","testimonial_33tAjm","testimonial_dDRMwy"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"scheme-9","heading":"Over 2,000 Happy reviews","heading_size":"h2","heading_highlight_style":"none","subheading":"","description":"","text_size":"text-base","card_color_scheme":"","card_layout":"1","columns_desktop":3,"column_gap":"medium","enable_slider":true,"columns_mobile":"1","swipe_on_mobile":true,"padding_top":100,"padding_bottom":100,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed"}},"rich_text_JnpVRU":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_GrtErd":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Description","heading_size":"hd1","heading_highlight_style":"none"}},"text_YinYx7":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h2><strong>Upgrade your desktop space anytime, anywhere with the Lumipia adjustable camera desk mount!<\/strong><\/h2><p>This extendable camera desk mount is made of durable aluminum alloy, offering flexible design to effectively enhance your desktop lighting and shooting setup based on your specific needs.<\/p><h2><strong>Key Features:<\/strong><\/h2><p><strong>Adjustable Height<\/strong><\/p><p>The Lumipia camera desk mount can easily extend from 17\" to 37\", allowing you to customize your shooting angle according to your needs.<\/p><p><strong>Sturdy Aluminum Alloy Construction<\/strong><\/p><p>Made from high-quality aluminum alloy, the camera desk light stand can support up to 11 pounds, ensuring your equipment remains secure and stable.<\/p><p><strong>Quick-Install Ball Head with 1\/4-Inch Screw<\/strong><\/p><p>The camera mount desk comes with a ball head featuring a 1\/4-inch screw, making it easy to attach cameras, lights, and other devices to meet your streaming or shooting needs.<\/p><p><strong>Compact and Portable Design<\/strong><\/p><p>This camera stand for desk is easy to install and perfect for creators and professional photographers who need flexibility and stability in their workspace.<\/p><p><strong>User-Friendly Operation<\/strong><\/p><p>With simple adjustments, you can easily position your camera or lighting for optimal performance, ensuring perfect results. This camera mount desk is the ideal solution for streamers, creators, and professionals.<\/p><p>This camera desk light stand is perfect for those seeking stability and precision in their shooting and live streaming setups. Upgrade your workspace today with the Lumipia camera mount desk!<\/p>","text_size":"text-base"}}},"block_order":["heading_GrtErd","text_YinYx7"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"","content_alignment":"left","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"show_section_divider":false,"divider_width":"fixed"}},"feature_list_cW3d9c":{"type":"feature-list","blocks":{"feature_item_VbCwL3":{"type":"feature_item","settings":{"color_scheme":"","icon":"check","icon_style"